# --- Room 1/18 ---
dig Silverwood Glade - Entrance
@desc You have found a small clearing where dim luminescence streams through a break in the cypresses overhead. You notice a weathered statue resting here, and the forest seems to hold its breath around you.
@tags/set room-zone:silverwood_glade
@open south=south to Silverwood Glade - Expanse 2
@open east=east to Silverwood Glade - Grove

# --- Room 2/18 ---
dig Silverwood Glade - Grove
@desc A narrow trail winds through the twisted undergrowth. You hear strange whispers echoing among the oaks and spot a dark bloodstain half-hidden in the cracked stone.
@tags/set room-zone:silverwood_glade
@spawn gen_skirmisher_lvl5
@tel here
@open west=west to Silverwood Glade - Entrance
